  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">매번 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&lt;성취기준&gt;</span></b> <b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">파일 찾는게</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">너무 피곤</span></b>해서 &#128553;<br>&#160;<br><b>온라인에서</b> <b>바로 볼</b>&#160;수 있는 방법을<br>찾다가 만들어봅니다 <br>&#160;<br><b><a href=\"http://bit.ly/2022중학교과학\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">bit.ly/2022중학교과학</span></a></b><br>(한번만 주소창에 치고나면,<br>다음엔 bi 만 쳐도 바로 뜹니다)<br>&#160;<br>단원별 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">성취기준</span></b>과<br>잘 안보는 <b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">성취수준</span></b>도<br>함께 볼 수 있게 <b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">버튼</span></b>으로 만들었습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51e73d693c2d1d1d42410df51e268c488741104e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51e73d693c2d1d1d42410df51e268c488741104e\" data-origin-width=\"1867\" data-origin-height=\"838\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">첨엔 <b>고등꺼도 만들다가</b><br><b>제 미천한 능력으론</b><br><b>수명이....</b><br><b>줄어드는 느낌</b>이....&#128552;&#128552;&#128552;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">중학교만 올려봅니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br>엉망진창 와장창인<br>코드도 파일 부끄럽지만 open!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a14ebe164710a1b9b81430dbecf2674b402b991?download\" data-file-name=\"index.html\" data-file-size=\"81773\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D355%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20251122124051&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3a14ebe164710a1b9b81430dbecf2674b402b991')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">index</span><span class=\"type\">.html</span></div><div class=\"size\">